LongBench v2 request sources

Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/zai-org/LongBench-v2
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.15204
Authors: Yushi Bai, Shangqing Tu, Jiajie Zhang, Hao Peng, Xiaozhi Wang,
Xin Lv, Shulin Cao, Jiazheng Xu, Lei Hou, Yuxiao Dong, Jie Tang, Juanzi Li.
The dataset declares Apache License 2.0; see LONGBENCH_LICENSE.

No LongBench v2 data is bundled in this package. At runtime the original
InferenceBench evaluator downloads the dataset inside the sandbox and applies
its seeded selection and head truncation with the served model's tokenizer.
The dataset and model are not revision-pinned by InferenceBench; each run's
provenance records the hashes of the prompts it actually used.
